item+ function src/plan.rs :: evaluate_gate :: pub fn evaluate_gate(current: &DiskObs, vol: Option<&Volume>, files_root: &str, cfg: &GateConfig) -> GateEval { :: Evaluate the disk gate from values: the current observation, the measured volume, the file count's root, the thresholds. Byte half = the worse of the lenses that are ON; disk gate = the worse of byte and file halves. The observation's own level word is NOT consulted: since the telemetry series is qexo's own, the level recorded with an observation is this very evaluation's output (the caller stamps it), not an input. :: doc comment :: 305 :: 1
