item+ const src/plan.rs :: FORECAST_HORIZON_DAYS :: pub const FORECAST_HORIZON_DAYS: f64 = 365.0; :: How far ahead a crossing projection is reported, in days. A linear rate read off the last interval is a short-horizon instrument: a crossing farther out than this will be re-projected hundreds of times before it can matter, and naming a day count for it lends it a precision it does not have. Crossings beyond the horizon are reported as no crossing. :: doc comment :: 430 :: 1
